  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Mephodio/EmiEnchants/raw/master/media/demo.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femienchants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/11hKNQb2?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SpfwvM7dm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/bb2913a71d7513370db93a85a313af402b1a41e3ceccb2a87f46847601c05cda/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f446973636f72642d2532333538363546322e7376673f7374796c653d666f722d7468652d6261646765266c6f676f3d646973636f7264266c6f676f436f6c6f723d7768697465\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 插件，用于查看附魔信息。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>显示：\n<ul>\n<li>附魔名称、所属模组、最高等级</li>\n<li>分类及可应用的物品列表</li>\n<li>稀有度、权重、每级成本（参见 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fEnchantment_weight\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki</a>）</li>\n<li>冲突附魔列表</li>\n<li>是否可通过附魔台获得</li>\n<li>是否可从村民处购买</li>\n<li>是否可从各类战利品源获取（宝箱、钓鱼、生物装备掉落）</li>\n<li>是否为宝藏附魔（村民会以两倍价格出售）</li>\n<li>是否为诅咒附魔</li>\n<li>描述信息（由模组或资源包提供）。推荐查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>查看物品的用途以了解适用的附魔</li>\n<li>查看附魔书的配方或用途以了解其附魔属性。受限于 EMI，目前仅支持包含单个附魔的书籍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Forge 版本兼容 NeoForge 1.20.1。其他版本的支持将在后续添加。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
